# Doc-first

Before changing behaviour, a guard, a module contract or a design choice, update the documentation that
describes it, and commit that first: an ADR for reversible decisions, otherwise the module README, guide, runbook
or security model. Full rule: [documentation mandate](../../docs/contributing/documentation-mandate.md).
